<view class="container home-page">
  <view class="hero card">
    <text class="section-title">英语场景前后端联调</text>
    <text class="section-subtitle">当前前端模板已经改成 API 驱动，现在支持上传图片、创建生成任务、热点编辑，以及 mock 支付购买会员和点数。</text>
    <view class="hero-actions">
      <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onOpen" data-url="/pages/products/index">查看商品</button>
      <button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="onOpen" data-url="/pages/orders/index">查看订单</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="action-list">
    <view wx:for="{{actions}}" wx:key="id" class="action-card card" bindtap="onOpen" data-url="{{item.url}}">
      <text class="action-title">{{item.title}}</text>
      <text class="action-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
